    <strong>Workout Participation Rate: 83.1%</strong> — 3,325 of 4,000 daily records include a workout session. Rest days (NaN/No Workout) account for 675 records (16.9%). Gym is the most common workout type (17.2%), followed closely by Walking (16.9%) and Yoga (16.9%).
